     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you tremendously Professor!<div>- and thank you for all your articles and books. I have become really interested in distance sampling, </div><div>and almost have all your books now. - they are such a great help, and for the first time (ever!), we actually have density and abundance estimates for long-tailed macaques.</div><div>very exciting!</div><div>All the best</div><div>Malene</div></div>"
    ],
